BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alexus Lee Concert at Linden Place
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:aede3fa168dd913c7b46c63f5776@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Spirits &amp\; Mind Games: A Halloween Cocktail Party When: Fr
 iday\, November 13th at 7:00 PM Where: Linden Place\, 500 Hope Street\, Br
 istol Tickets: $26 General Admission\, $20.80 Members Enjoy a concert by s
 inger\, songwriter Alexus Lee in the historic Carriage House Ballroom\, kn
 own for its ambiance. The performance will take place on Saturday\, Novemb
 er 14\, 2026 at 7:00 PM. Alexus Lee dazzles audiences with her soulful sto
 rytelling\, masterful vocals and infectious grooves. Her skillful ability 
 for storytelling\, and commanding stage presence\, have carried her to cou
 ntless cities\, states\, and countries around the world. The Berklee gradu
 ate has shared stages with world class talents such as Mac Ayres\, has bee
 n featured in a number of online\, television and print publications\; inc
 luding The Marquis Who’s Who In America\, The Providence Journal\, PBS\,
  WPRI\, The Boston Chronicle\, and has been nominated for Rhode Island Mus
 ic Awards for “Best Vocalist” of 2022“ and “Best RnB Act” of 202
 3 and 2024. Tickets are priced at $25 for general admission\, $20 for Lind
 en Place members. Be sure to reserve your tickets in advance!\n\nSource: h
 ttps://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/alexus-lee-concert-at-linden-place/1
 11838/
LOCATION:Linden Place\, 500 Hope Street\, Bristol\, RI 02809
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/alexus-lee-concert-at-linden-pl
 ace/111838/
END:VEVENT
