 rrive late\, the artist may not be able to fill you in on the steps you mi
 ssed\, as they will be focused on guiding the rest of the class. If you ar
 rive more than 20 minutes late\, we kindly ask that you do not join the se
 ssion. Late arrivals can be disruptive and may not have enough time to com
 plete the painting. Unfortunately\, we cannot offer refunds or reschedules
  for late arrivals. 🚗 PARKING INFO Our studio is located at 150 Main St
 reet (rear entrance)\, Pawtucket\, Rhode Island\, and we have two FREE par
 king lots: 🚗 One directly attached to our entrance 🚗 A second lot ju
 st one building down on the same side of the street — clearly labeled 
 🪑 WANT TO SIT WITH FRIENDS? If you purchased 2 or more tickets in one t
 ransaction\, we’ll automatically seat your group together. If you booked
  separately but want to sit with someone\, please include their first and 
 last names in the “Additional Information / Order Notes” field during 
 checkout. 🔄 RESCHEDULING &amp\; CANCELLATION POLICY All reservations ar
 e non-refundable. However\, if you need to reschedule\, you may request a 
 reschedule voucher at least 48 hours before your session. You can do this 
 easily on our website — just [click here]. No-shows cannot be reschedule
 d. 🚨 CLASS CANCELLATION Classes may be canceled due to low attendance. 
 In this case\, we’ll notify you and issue a voucher for a future session
 . We appreciate your understanding and look forward to welcoming you to a 
 future class! ❄️ INCLEMENT WEATHER POLICY Because New England weather 
