DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, Centreville Bank Stadium will be transfo
 rmed into a spectacular winter wonderland as the Rhode Island Lights Festi
 val brings together dazzling light displays\, festive entertainment\, holi
 day shopping\, seasonal food and beverages\, and unforgettable experiences
  for guests of all ages. Whether you're beginning a new family tradition\,
  planning a magical date night\, gathering with friends\, or celebrating w
 ith coworkers\, the Rhode Island Lights Festival is designed to capture th
 e joy\, warmth\, and wonder of the holiday season. From strolling through 
 thousands of sparkling lights and discovering unique gifts in the Holiday 
 Market to enjoying festive treats\, meeting Santa\, and creating memories 
 that will last a lifetime\, every visit offers something special. No matte
 r how you choose to celebrate\, the Rhode Island Lights Festival has an ex
 perience designed just for you.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.co
 m/event/rhode-island-lights-festival/112530/
LOCATION:Centreville Bank Stadium\, 11 Tidewater Street\, Pawtucket\, 0268
 0 Time: 5:00 PM to 10:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/rhode-island-lights-festival/11
 2530/
END:VEVENT
