BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blowing Bubbles ~ Make Your Own Ornament - November
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:c64da7dafbfe82f8529e223312e2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our Blowing Bubbles class where each student learn
 s how to manipulate molten glass on the end of a 4-foot pipe. In this Blow
 ing Bubbles session\, instructors demonstrate shaping techniques using woo
 den and metal tools. You will decorate your Blowing Bubbles ornaments with
  different color applications to create unique pieces. At the start of the
  Blowing Bubbles class\, there will be a demonstration to guide you. Our i
 nstructors will help you experience the magic of hot glass\, allowing you 
 to pick and apply colors\, twist and turn them\, then blow or shape them i
 nto a beautiful art glass piece. This Blowing Bubbles class accommodates u
 p to 8 people\, with each student receiving a one-on-one turn to create th
 eir own glass item to keep. While waiting for your Blowing Bubbles turn\, 
 you are encouraged to watch\, learn\, and support others. This class is op
 en to ages 12 and up. Finished products can be picked up after 2 days once
  they have finished annealing in our kilns. If you would like your items s
 hipped\, there is a $20 fee payable at pickup. This event runs from Nov 13
 \, 2026 to Nov 29\, 2026 and happens every: Fridays: 6:00pm - 7:30pm Satur
 days: 12:30pm - 2:00pm Saturdays: 4:30pm - 6:00pm Sundays: 12:45pm - 2:15p
 m Sundays: 4:30pm - 6:00pm\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/eve
 nt/blowing-bubbles-make-your-own-ornament-november/112610/
LOCATION:Blackstone River Glass Center\, 30 Meeting Street\, Cumberland\, 
 20864
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/blowing-bubbles-make-your-own-o
 rnament-november/112610/
END:VEVENT
