DESCRIPTION:All are invited to Bosgraaf Stained Glass Studio’s 11th Annu
 al Holiday Sale\, featuring original glass works from over 60 student arti
 sts and a 6-foot artist-painted Nutcracker named Sir Fluxalot. This very s
 pecial event that takes place over two days and a portion of proceeds bene
 fit the Johnnycake Youth Center in Peace Dale. Saturday\, Dec 5\, 2026 fro
 m 10:00am &#8211\; 4:00pm &amp\; Sunday\, Dec 6\, 2026 from 10:00am &#8211
 \; 3:00pm Art glass pieces abound with locally-inspired designs\, and holi
 day\, nature\, whimsical\, and enchanting pieces for every price range. Th
 e public will get to view and choose from hundreds of unique creative stai
 ned glass and fused glass pieces that are functional and decorative. Handc
 rafted holiday ornaments will abound as always — this is the perfect sto
 p for hostess gifts and holiday decor! Credit cards accepted. All ages are
  welcome. Everyone who attends receives a complimentary hot chocolate and 
 raffle prize entry. Gooseneck Vineyards is hosting a wine tasting on site
 \, Saturday December 5th from 1:00pm-3:00pm. Location: 1214 Kingstown Road
  Peace Dale\, RI 02879 Event contact: Peggy Corcoran bosgraafstudio@gmail.
 com Facebook Event: https://www.facebook.com/share/1GvYWUxEQS Website: htt
 ps://www.bosgraafstudio.com/11th-annual-art-sale-hot-chocolate-happening\n
