BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:90's vs Y2K New Years Eve
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:cd9739dc5ca20722a765f80113db@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to step into a time warp this New Year's Eve at Ball
 y's 90s vs. Y2K Party! As you walk through the doors\, you're instantly tr
 ansported back to the iconic decade\, where glitter and neon rule the nigh
 t. A room shimmers with sequins and metallic streamers\, setting the scene
  for a night that's equal parts nostalgia and pure 90s magic. Everywhere y
 ou look\, people are decked out in throwback fashion-baggy low-rise jeans
 \, crop tops\, chokers\, oversized blazers\, and bucket hats-transforming 
 the venue into a vibrant flashback of pop culture's greatest era. Feel the
  familiar beat hit as a live DJ spins a playlist packed with the unforgett
 able anthems of the 90s. The air comes alive with Britney's iconic hooks\,
  Mariah's soaring notes\, and the harmonies of Boyz II Men\, each song dra
 wing you deeper into the moment. Enjoy a musical performance by the Felix 
 Brown Band. Be amazed by a show by Mentalist David Hall and magician Peter
  Boie and laugh amongst your friends and family as you are in awe of their
  mentalist/ magic show. Get ready for the largest 90's dance party in Rhod
 e Island\, filled with all of these hits! As the midnight countdown approa
 ches\, the room dims\, anticipation buzzing through the crowd. Giant scree
 ns light up with retro graphics\, flashing 90s-inspired designs\, and ever
 yone joins in\, counting down in unison\, caught between past and future. 
 When the clock strikes twelve\, the lights dazzle\, and everyone raises th
 eir glasses to both the magic of the 90s and the promise of a brand new ye
 ar. This New Year's Eve\, you're not just celebrating-you're time-travelin
 g back to an unforgettable era filled with nostalgia and excitement. Don't
  just watch the ball drop\; come relive the ultimate 90s experience and st
 art the new year with a blast from the past!Get tickets now before prices 
 rise! URL: Tickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3619726-0?pid=10404 Date and Time
 : Thursday\, 31 December 2026 at 19:00 - Friday\, 01 January 2027 at 02:00
  Venue details: Bally's Lincoln\, 100 Twin River Rd\, Lincoln\, Rhode Isla
 nd\, 02865\, United States Category: Community | Local / Community Price: 
 General Admission: USD 52.00\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/e
 vent/90s-vs-y2k-new-years-eve/110031/
LOCATION:Bally's Lincoln\, 100 Twin River Rd\, Lincoln\, 02865
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/90s-vs-y2k-new-years-eve/110031
 /
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Christmas Carol
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:7974b08503c8ecfb69cc65bc6b84@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:By Charles Dickens Original Music by Richard Cumming Directed 
 by Taavon Gamble November 5 &#8211\; December 31\, 2026 Dowling Theater Ce
 lebrating 50 Years of Holiday Cheer As the clock strikes midnight on a fat
 eful Christmas Eve\, Ebenezer Scrooge gets an unexpected visit from the gh
 ost of his former partner\, Jacob Marley. In a world shaped by music\, mem
 ory\, and possibility\, Scrooge is swept into a supernatural journey throu
 gh past\, present\, and future. Along the way\, he must confront what he h
 as built\, what he has lost\, and what he still has: the power to change f
 or the good of his community\, and his very soul. This year’s 50th anniv
 ersary production\, directed by company member Taavon Gamble\, celebrates 
 the beloved legacy of Trinity Rep’s annual tradition of reimagining the 
 story anew each year.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-
 christmas-carol/63625/
LOCATION:Trinity Rep\, 201 Washington Street\, Providence\, RI 02903
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-christmas-carol/63625/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beyond the Brewhouse Tour
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:c7b48636db9ede5f5acbbb263d31@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the Brewhouse Where: Newport Craft Brewing and Distilli
 ng\, 293 JT Connell Road\, Newport 45 minutes: $20 per person Did you know
  that we are a Distillery too? Going beyond the brewhouse\, our expert tou
 r guide will provide you with an in-depth explanation of our brewing and d
 istilling processes. Tour the brewhouse\, take a peek at our Sour room\, a
 nd walk through our distillery. Conclude the tour with a brew and spirit f
 light for a complete palate experience. Ages 21+\n\nSource: https://www.vi
 sitrhodeisland.com/event/beyond-the-brewhouse-tour/110153/
LOCATION:Newport Craft Brewing & Distilling Company\, 293 JT Connell Road
 \, Newport\, RI 02840 Time: 45 minutes: Tour start time varies by booking.
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/beyond-the-brewhouse-tour/11015
 3/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Holds Barred: New Year's Eve Soirée
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTSTAMP:20261113T180117Z
UID:ea8226b17ae15d63a31d0f4ca882@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Imbibe with endless Champagne\, handcrafted cocktails and indu
 lgent culinary delights as you listen to live music at The Vanderbilt’s 
 New Year’s Eve Soirée. Enjoy passed bites\, sumptuous stationed food an
 d open bar and other festive surprises and delights. Dress in your finest 
 attire and usher in 2027 amongst the Gilded Age glamour of the East Coast
 ’s most iconic mansion. Thursday\, December 31 | 8 PM - 12:30 AM 21+ eve
 nt | Tickets include open bar\, passed hors d'oeuvres\, stationed food\, a
 ccess to all entertainment Non-refundable Dress Code: Black Tie\n\nSource:
  https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/no-holds-barred%3a-new-years-eve-s
 oir%c3%a9e/112630/
LOCATION:The Vanderbilt\, Auberge Collection\, 41 Mary Street\, Newport\, 
 02840 Time: 8:00 PM to 12:30 AM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/no-holds-barred%3a-new-years-ev
 e-soir%c3%a9e/112630/
END:VEVENT
